@@ -32,6 +33,8 @@ Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 - Writes require the `contributor` or `manager` role in the project. Users who can read but not write get 403.
 - Contributors may only modify tasks assigned to themselves, and may not reassign tasks. Managers may modify any task.
 - Only managers may delete tasks.
+- Only managers may change member roles. A bulk role change is all or nothing: if any target is not a member of the project, or any role is not one of the three roles, the request fails with 400 and nothing changes. An empty `roles` object → 400.
